msgstr "Toepassings-id"


msgid "As found"
msgstr "Zoals gevonden"


msgid "Ask for read-only access"
msgstr "Alleen-lezen toegang aanvragen"


msgid "By name, A to Z"
msgstr "Op naam, A tot Z"


msgid "By name, Z to A"
msgstr "Op naam, Z tot A"


msgid "Can fix transfers that stall on some networks and proxies."
msgstr "Kan helpen bij overdrachten die op sommige netwerken of via proxyservers vastlopen."


